  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 302.10 Certified tank installer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 302.10 “Certified tank installer” means an individual who is certified:\n\n(a) By the International Code Council in “AST system installation/retrofitting;” and\n\n(b) By the equipment manufacturer as being qualified in the installation of the manufacturer’s equipment or individual system components, as applicable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 300) #10487, eff 2-7-14; ss by #14094, eff 10-4-24 (formerly Env-Or 302.09)",
